{"ts": 1791254705.817237, "type": "step", "step": 14, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "Here\u2019s the build requirement I found for Friday: you need to (1) define your environment clearly \u2014 state, observations, actions, and dynamics \u2014 and (2) report pass^k on at least 3 seeds. For the learning side, the key readings are about what an environment is, partial observability/POMDPs, attention as a hidden variable, and the difference between pass@k and pass^k. \n\nQuick check: can you tell me, in your own words, why pass^k is the metric they care about for the build, and what the hidden-variable idea means for attention?", "intent": "explain", "concept": "week3-build"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: hm ok\n[activity] t=0 messages 4m", "t": 4, "activity": [{"t": 0, "app": "messages", "minutes": 4, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.27095871991980863, "pomdp": 0.27095871991980863, "pass_k": 0.27095871991980863}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 0.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.9313219651533418, "motivation": 0.5578498928708127, "reliance": 0.4740148929158049, "persistence": 0.47206578426655554, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.27845959405872756, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.2718838204667282, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 1.0, "seen_posts": []}}
{"ts": 1791254706.460194, "type": "step", "step": 15, "action": "quiz_run", "args": {"concept": "week3-build", "n_items": 2, "difficulty": 0.2}, "output": "Quiz result: 0/2 correct.\n[activity] t=4 quiz 5m; t=9 quiz 1m", "t": 10, "activity": [{"t": 4, "app": "quiz", "minutes": 5, "detail": ""}, {"t": 9, "app": "quiz", "minutes": 1, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.27095871991980863, "pomdp": 0.27095871991980863, "pass_k": 0.27095871991980863}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 0.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.9113219651533417, "motivation": 0.5578498928708127, "reliance": 0.4740148929158049, "persistence": 0.47206578426655554, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.27845959405872756, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.2718838204667282, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 1.0, "seen_posts": []}}
{"ts": 1791254708.666189, "type": "step", "step": 16, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "No worries \u2014 that just tells us what to review. I\u2019m going to help you build the two parts the assignment asks for:\n\n1) **Environment definition**: write down the state, observations, actions, and dynamics for your build.\n2) **Evaluation**: report **pass^k** on at least **3 seeds**.\n\nA useful way to think about it:\n- **pass@k** = did at least one of the k runs succeed?\n- **pass^k** = did all k runs succeed?\n\nFor this build, the more relevant question is reliability across runs, so pass^k matters.\n\nMini-hint: if you can\u2019t see the full truth of your system from the observations, that\u2019s a **partial observability** situation; then attention/information-gathering can matter too.\n\nTry answering these two quick questions:\n- What are the 4 pieces of your environment definition?\n- Why would someone prefer pass^k over pass@k for deployment reliability?", "intent": "hint", "concept": "week3-build"}, "output": "Sent.\n[activity] t=10 messages 2m", "t": 12, "activity": [{"t": 10, "app": "messages", "minutes": 2, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.27095871991980863, "pomdp": 0.27095871991980863, "pass_k": 0.27095871991980863}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 0.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.9113219651533417, "motivation": 0.5578498928708127, "reliance": 0.4940148929158049, "persistence": 0.47206578426655554, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.27845959405872756, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.2718838204667282, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 1.7, "seen_posts": []}}
{"ts": 1791254710.123465, "type": "step", "step": 17, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "Let\u2019s make this practical. Please send me either:\n1) a rough draft of your environment definition, or\n2) the exact system/project you\u2019re building for Friday.\n\nIf you\u2019re stuck, fill these blanks:\n- State:\n- Observations:\n- Actions:\n- Dynamics:\n- What counts as success:\n\nThen I\u2019ll help you tighten it up and make sure you can compute pass^k on 3 seeds.", "intent": "nudge", "concept": "week3-build"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: hm ok\n[activity] t=12 messages 1m", "t": 13, "activity": [{"t": 12, "app": "messages", "minutes": 1, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.27095871991980863, "pomdp": 0.27095871991980863, "pass_k": 0.27095871991980863}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 0.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.9113219651533417, "motivation": 0.5078498928708126, "reliance": 0.4940148929158049, "persistence": 0.47206578426655554, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.27845959405872756, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.2718838204667282, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 2.19, "seen_posts": []}}
